            <lg xml:id="m-1e6f0688-f1db-414b-b105-323e744b5752">
              <l xml:id="m-72c8093d-bfbd-4307-93f3-ab1fe9585070" facs="#m-3bc38286-3c36-44ec-8e19-e18e1db1e651" label="ambiguous">1354°</l><l xml:id="m-f58c4db4-c70b-4a25-b078-411e343f1059" facs="#m-af3da262-cbb4-4cf8-8579-d3c0dc37d0fd" label="ambiguous">February I.</l><l xml:id="m-b03861d8-364e-48af-9318-744d84cfa9fe" facs="#m-d6beb2f7-6cde-44b3-b857-33c735dc9d1a" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. Rom. 8.f.</l><l xml:id="m-5bc15308-e3b9-4f03-851d-4bc59346de1c" facs="#m-497eb880-a7da-4a14-b465-1ede99bab933" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Quis nos separábit a ca¬ sum enim, quia neque mors, neque</l><l xml:id="m-14d6c344-dc96-40c4-a37b-971d80c04f57" facs="#m-248b7caf-7463-45c1-8819-25f35c8d9370" label="lyrics-like">I ritáte Christi? Tribulátio, an</l><l xml:id="m-70d616ef-0096-44c6-8cc4-3305793cf89c" facs="#m-32415bd8-84c5-4661-8b7c-36e39940b2d6" label="lyrics-like">vita, neque Angeli, neque principá¬</l><l xml:id="m-85c9da14-058d-4b2a-a497-6426bc6b296b" facs="#m-9ca8b9c5-1c62-4dba-843e-ea23f7c53528" label="lyrics-like">tus, neque virtútes, neque instãn¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb7900cd-8d63-4bf1-9f57-c059094bdd11" facs="#m-bd28d461-bbb3-4774-bdfa-e5b85fcb0ed0" label="lyrics-like">angústia, an fames, an núditas, an</l><l xml:id="m-fd607b97-245e-4794-9eb0-c7b5232b7aa3" facs="#m-6618c379-abcc-4926-8b2c-0a2f8eaa5077" label="lyrics-like">tia, neque futúra, neque fortitúdo,</l><l xml:id="m-7a899e63-e188-40b6-8fcf-299b63a536d2" facs="#m-8a3de8fa-9084-4371-a3c2-a774d4fe8dcd" label="lyrics-like">periculum, an persecútio, an glá¬</l><l xml:id="m-bace4319-e44f-468a-a31e-e93fcd508424" facs="#m-b18707c4-fc5d-44a9-8601-590b10d7c43e" label="ambiguous">dius? (sicut scriptum est : Quia pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-4995e1fa-da49-4782-a8e1-2c655ea7641f" facs="#m-058e9b12-16bd-4ea6-a275-4d24e95cc2d3" label="lyrics-like">neque altitúdo, neque profúndum,</l><l xml:id="m-f841bc6d-f2db-441d-8a58-b74a77ecf7b6" facs="#m-4a89f093-93f9-4d5d-8fee-872830ba8480" label="lyrics-like">pter te mortificámur tota die:</l><l xml:id="m-8891a826-db9b-41da-9fda-ff1826eb26c7" facs="#m-2e9cbb69-960c-4676-a138-67455d3d1ee6" label="lyrics-like">neque creatúra ália póterit nos se¬</l><l xml:id="m-8704b422-bc55-4fd0-b5ae-89c3fb3dbbb0" facs="#m-50a46cc4-b32b-4d18-9644-3cb67eb9efc3" label="lyrics-like">parare a caritáte Dei, quae est in</l><l xml:id="m-f17a5d61-ec3c-47ca-aab1-47f01727411f" facs="#m-e5706dd9-a7a9-4a5a-bcbf-76da0e469ba4" label="lyrics-like">aestimáti sumus sicut oves occisió¬</l><l xml:id="m-189f3a19-8fd4-4f6c-afc7-2cca8e628927" facs="#m-6ee38f72-db60-4d41-8382-5cf4986b9514" label="lyrics-like">nis.) Sed in his ómnibus superámus</l><l xml:id="m-f8c0cf94-ce96-4adf-a422-8d477000a03b" facs="#m-0f3ffe96-9c5b-4086-bca5-23a1dbdb5326" label="lyrics-like">Christo Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-23b3dcd8-0db8-4822-b3a7-2d144e72c934" facs="#m-cf1be7d1-8a75-4746-81f9-5b918b00bcda" label="lyrics-like">propter eum qui diléxit nos. Certus</l><l xml:id="m-3ee7c7f7-c1bb-443b-b89b-178ab504d6e6" facs="#m-43b6901f-c9aa-4bbc-895b-ce723c93778e" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Ecce sacérdos mágnus. p. 1183.</l><l xml:id="m-49b66a32-f09a-46fd-8afd-2bb12c01a0c4" facs="#m-6e371a46-1c3c-4fd9-ab5d-f51c0063cc80" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-7536f31a-8242-4918-b16b-c4a0d6bc8ed7" facs="#m-1835691b-7e30-47ee-8d47-c3296ff1c629" label="ambiguous">H ne</l><l xml:id="m-70d9a83a-6296-41a9-b2f3-082da2a88aa9" facs="#m-3bcecf26-290f-4ea1-8c81-f59f6e1c1d6c" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.— ij.</l><l xml:id="m-5d26630e-92c2-45a5-8256-ab9cf697989b" facs="#m-fdd1ff87-623e-4057-bfa8-ddf24d5dd3af" label="lyrics-like">V. Chrísto</l><l xml:id="m-68821ebd-0d77-4421-8f0b-761728a4bae7" facs="#m-cb4b3c79-bec8-4330-b77b-b33c87415234" label="lyrics-like">confí¬</l><l xml:id="m-73922403-0483-457e-90f7-95e599354173" facs="#m-65356b5d-7e20-45d4-9868-f6e123b732be" label="lyrics-like">xus sum crúci: vi-vo é¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ca8b752-c85c-4219-b0f6-20544f3ef783" facs="#m-2e841096-f2e1-4075-93e6-6a73b9ba17d4" label="lyrics-like">ví-vit ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b2f95d2-21fe-4057-8c05-02649a3d783f" facs="#m-7292c449-35d9-4feb-807f-0282763e3089" label="ambiguous">go, jam</l><l xml:id="m-1b312ca5-8ca0-4883-bc41-6eea945b9e47" facs="#m-14d4a359-d996-4da1-916a-50fd03966697" label="lyrics-like">non égo,</l><l xml:id="m-e6f1af85-14bd-46e7-ac97-d9ab7fa9003d" facs="#m-7c0dfa2e-15c9-487e-a7ca-6087f7ac609b" label="ambiguous">ro</l><l xml:id="m-20a74eb7-cc38-4f8c-90a8-fefb4c7bf11a" facs="#m-492db539-5cf4-49f1-9de5-178e4ab6a36e" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-1294a755-0df1-4f68-9901-ca80fad180cb" facs="#m-9d68ec02-fe09-4e0e-86ed-0e9ad72d00bd" label="lyrics-like">"*Chrístus.</l><l xml:id="m-04643dbe-21de-4c24-ba4c-305218550a6a" facs="#m-8eaec424-ee71-4cb3-b576-c4c40ed88138" label="ambiguous">me</l><l xml:id="m-c768a832-136f-48db-a800-c4cc53d20c6a" facs="#m-c45d418d-94d1-4514-b095-0f33d7cd665f" label="text-like">After Septuagesima, the Alleluia. and its Verse are omitted, and the Tract</l><l xml:id="m-a0c7f404-907a-4e46-9407-fe3ef45f508f" facs="#m-7448ebcc-0460-43e2-bde1-d75ab2541ac2" label="lyrics-like">Desidérium, p. 1181. is said instead.</l><l xml:id="m-7b7c5f2e-20bc-4fd6-a03c-ffa81e706c64" facs="#m-40323ed0-7433-45c2-b8fe-43d49b4b04aa" label="ambiguous">* Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 12. d.</l><l xml:id="m-a76d7cd2-705e-40ff-923a-3756534e7673" facs="#m-8bf7f3ab-491c-4a78-9bd0-9f15dc64db00" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí¬et qui odit ánimam suam in hoc</l><l xml:id="m-37c356c9-5b26-4310-b958-ab417a86b182" facs="#m-7e14c4d3-b746-421e-934b-088ddc85dc51" label="ambiguous">A pulis suis: Amen, amen dico</l><l xml:id="m-05648b2f-d082-4f11-94eb-38cec357b3ad" facs="#m-f7c6511b-36e4-4e8c-bf4a-ac6549cee923" label="lyrics-like">mundo, in vitam aetérnam custó¬</l><l xml:id="m-99efd0c8-ef3e-4ad6-8806-a70b5a0e22fe" facs="#m-bea27e73-4928-403d-ae73-6e778d96debf" label="ambiguous">dit eam. Si quis mihi ministrat, me</l><l xml:id="m-2f618438-2400-48e4-a666-617f7b75af81" facs="#m-baa7b122-c82f-4522-acf0-2f52007221ee" label="lyrics-like">vobis, nisi granum fruménti cadens</l><l xml:id="m-f83986c3-0024-4ea7-8754-de2837287068" facs="#m-80cfe050-dc3c-48dd-9808-a89ed5531430" label="lyrics-like">in terram mórtuum fúerit, ipsum</l><l xml:id="m-209c51c4-d24a-4a64-96d0-d4d2dc5777ef" facs="#m-b708bbcc-2353-4714-99c9-37c82b53582d" label="lyrics-like">sequátur: et ubi sum ego, illic et</l><l xml:id="m-9e3e2c04-d33d-499d-92f6-638dfb6dc88b" facs="#m-0175e24c-2945-4ae3-9769-45e27934c2c7" label="lyrics-like">miníster meus erit. Si quis mihi</l><l xml:id="m-aef78087-96dc-458c-b44a-801f99bb57ea" facs="#m-2b3d2b89-c654-42dd-b546-45a8e11bf214" label="lyrics-like">solum manet. Si autem mórtuum</l><l xml:id="m-b00d5de6-bd46-4cca-bd22-bc9ab362437f" facs="#m-5d8a9b7f-6958-4d02-a16a-4ef9b941fbeb" label="ambiguous">fuerit, multum fructum affert. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-8117c616-acea-4e1d-8794-dff57a9b0b1a" facs="#m-414594b8-16df-4214-9742-57cfaf0d9324" label="lyrics-like">ministráverit, honorificábit eum Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-31aa3192-db53-45fb-bc3d-7b5376b9d2e5" facs="#m-5341c17c-0cb3-4e0e-ae11-53114ea9d9be" label="lyrics-like">amat ánimam suam, perdet eam:l ter meus.</l><l xml:id="m-ea287408-a49e-4835-bf9d-cc6dd2b07c03" facs="#m-c12fe5d6-a647-493f-810e-dce2bee2b03c" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Glória et honóre. 1137.</l><l xml:id="m-f0d913ec-015f-4874-bbe0-9b6dcdf4f498" facs="#m-d0ed9e6d-fd46-4674-a873-e02af9c9fed0" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Hóstias tibi Dómine. p. 1182.</l><l xml:id="m-b7bdf62b-1c87-4f87-b6be-4746e48632f5" facs="#m-2daad48a-e39d-48e7-99a7-61e85dbeec52" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-6d0457eb-24d3-42a9-aa11-a3f1b38ba074" facs="#m-fb48767a-1503-47d2-8f88-e8d7f53a9c68" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-2017415c-c3da-47c1-8f79-46027828afdf" facs="#m-bc8e9784-6239-4427-9186-6a944aba9743" label="ambiguous">F</l><l xml:id="m-f249e959-f6b7-447d-9e60-1b0777d22e02" facs="#m-67e58164-3a83-45b8-9520-2f6638e87140" label="lyrics-like">Ruméntum Chrísti sum,* déntibus besti-á-rum</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>